# Images build from the repository root (the apps share packages/contracts)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.angular
**/.yarn-cache
# Settings are passed in at runtime, never built into an image
**/.env*
# …but this one is source: the frontend's version (ngx-scripts env)
!frontend/src/environments/.env.ts
backend/prisma/generated
.git
.github
